# Generated work-doc batches from running the tool against real projects.
# Example/schema batches (work_docs, work_docs_adb, organizer_work_docs) and
# the medtimingtracker_* batches (a real 12-batch, 36-task Android/Kotlin
# build -- see README's "Real-world example corpus" section) stay tracked;
# everything else ending in _work_docs is local output.
*_work_docs/
!/work_docs/
!/work_docs_adb/
!/organizer_work_docs/
!/medtimingtracker_*_work_docs/
